---
import { site } from "../lib/site";
---

<section class="sedation-strip bg-primary-dark py-16 text-white sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="sedation-strip-title">
  <div class="shell grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_.7fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-16">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow text-white/80">Comfort options at KC Endodontics</p>
      <h2 id="sedation-strip-title" class="font-heading mt-4 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-.02em] sm:text-5xl">Relax. We Offer Sedation Dentistry.</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/85">Nervous about a root canal? You are not alone. KC Endodontics offers sedation for endodontic treatment, and all patients are welcome to ask about it. Our Prairie Village office is in Kansas and also accepts Missouri Medicaid for sedation cases.</p>
      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap">
        <a class="button-inverse" href="/procedures/sedation-dentistry/">Explore Sedation Dentistry <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="button-inverse button-outline-inverse" href={site.phone.href}>Call {site.phone.display}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-5">
      <aside class="rounded-md border border-white/25 bg-white/10 p-7">
        <h3 class="eyebrow text-white/80">IV sedation</h3>
        <p class="font-heading mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold leading-snug">Administered and monitored by a board-eligible anesthesiologist. Benefits verified before treatment.</p>
      </aside>
      <aside class="rounded-md border border-white/25 bg-white/10 p-7">
        <h3 class="eyebrow text-white/80">A lighter touch</h3>
        <p class="font-heading mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold leading-snug">Nitrous oxide is available for children and adults, provided by Dr. Moore during your visit.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
